{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017sASZ6SQhyyuTpoPorgahG","type":"tool_result","content":"187-These options are persisted and used when reconnecting after hibernation or after OAuth completion. Default: 3 attempts, 500ms base delay, 5s max delay. See [Retries](./retries.md) for more details.\n188-\n189-### Protocol negotiation and elicitation\n190-\n191:Agents uses the MCP v2 client and automatically negotiates the protocol version for every connection. It uses `server/discover` with Stateless servers and falls back to the `initialize` handshake on the same connection for Legacy Streamable HTTP, SSE, and RPC servers.\n192-\n193-[Omitted long context line]\n194-\n195-Configure elicitation handlers before MCP connections are registered or restored:"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0cd48a39-626a-4612-baf9-7519507c9ab4","uuid":"bf5e6aaf-afdf-43a7-932f-19cf10c31dfc","timestamp":"2026-10-12T07:43:10.319Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"187-These options are persisted and used when reconnecting after hibernation or after OAuth completion. Default: 3 attempts, 500ms base delay, 5s max delay. See [Retries](./retries.md) for more details.\n188-\n189-### Protocol negotiation and elicitation\n190-\n191:Agents uses the MCP v2 client and automatically negotiates the protocol version for every connection. It uses `server/discover` with Stateless servers and falls back to the `initialize` handshake on the same connection for Legacy Streamable HTTP, SSE, and RPC servers.\n192-\n193-[Omitted long context line]\n194-\n195-Configure elicitation handlers before MCP connections are registered or restored:","numLines":9,"totalLines":9},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_017sASZ6SQhyyuTpoPorgahG","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
